  "description": "Yu-ah, an ordinary office worker, finds her escape in watching online broadcasts after a long day. Her favorite streams are those of a popular VTuber. One day, Yu-ah learns that these top VTubers earn more in a month than she does in a year. Exhausted by her repetitive life as an office worker, she starts dreaming of becoming a successful VTuber herself, quitting her job, and living as a full-time virtual content creator. Taking a leap of faith, Yu-ah debuts as the VTuber \"Yo-a-ring.\" Can Yu-ah achieve her dream of becoming a popular VTuber and leave her job behind for a new life as Yo-a-ring?\n\nOriginal Webtoon      \n[Official English](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4669-yu-ah-yo-a-ring)",
